/-! # What the papers on network estimation share

The definitions and results that two or more of this hub's papers use, and that the root library
`Phylogenetics` does not hold: a result that only one paper uses stays in that paper's repository,
and one that papers of several hubs use goes to `Phylogenetics`. Nothing yet.

Every module of this library is under `PhyloNetwork/`, in the namespace `PhyloNetwork`, and imports
only Mathlib, `Phylogenetics` and this library. -/
